# A cylinder's end face picked with the mouse and dimensioned on the
# front view of the drawing by its diameter (roadmap 29.2); the same as
# path_drawing_faces.go makes (TestPathEquivalenceDrawingFaces).
key c
move 300 300
down L 300 300
up L 300 300
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
key esc
key x shift
move 285 315
down L 285 315
up L 285 315
menu File|Drawing Sheet...
twmove 46 305
twdown L 46 305
twup L 46 305
edit front diameter
